{
  "name": "Weekly AI-search (GEO) & SEO audit of a site list → Google Sheets",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Weekly AI-search (GEO) + SEO audit for a list of websites\n\nReads URLs from a Google Sheet, audits each one with the **Web2Agent** API and writes a 0-100 score, A-D grade and the top issues to a second tab.\n\nChecks include `/llms.txt`, robots.txt rules for GPTBot / ClaudeBot / PerplexityBot / Google-Extended, JSON-LD, title/meta, H1 and image alt coverage.\n\n**Who it's for:** SEO & marketing agencies, in-house growth teams, anyone selling GEO audits.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "93ad97eb-7127-46a2-b8d9-317dee40376a",
      "name": "Note 49b997",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -200,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Google Sheet setup\nTab **Sites**: one column `url` (e.g. https://stripe.com)\n\nTab **Results**: leave empty — columns are created automatically:\n`url, checked_at, score, grade, issues_count, has_llms_txt, ai_bots_blocked, top_issues`\n\nPaste your sheet URL in both Google Sheets nodes.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "b4754672-0132-4eb9-9a39-564e43340845",
      "name": "Note e473e7",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        340,
        -360
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Credential (one time)\n1. Subscribe on RapidAPI (free BASIC plan works for testing).\n2. In n8n: **Credentials → New → Header Auth**\n   - Name: `x-rapidapi-key`\n   - Value: your RapidAPI key\n3. Select that credential in the HTTP Request node.\n\nNo key is stored inside this workflow.\n\nRequests are sent one per 1.5 s to respect plan limits.",
        "width": 400,
        "height": 300
      },
      "id": "0776428c-f055-4e51-a345-dc7563d0befd",
      "name": "Note 6fe013",
